## ✨ Features

### 🎨 Frontend
- **12 Complete Pages** — Home, About, Pricing, FAQ, Contact, Privacy, Terms, 404, Login, Signup, Dashboard, Settings
- **3D Visualization** — Real-time 3D cube tracking with Three.js
- **Smooth Animations** — GSAP-powered scroll animations
- **Smooth Scrolling** — Lenis for buttery-smooth experience
- **Dark Purple Theme** — Premium SaaS aesthetic
- **Fully Responsive** — Mobile-first with hamburger menu
- **Loading States** — Skeleton screens and spinners

### 🔐 Authentication
- **JWT-based Auth** — Secure token authentication
- **Bcrypt Password Hashing** — Industry-standard security
- **Session Management** — Persistent login
- **Profile Management** — Update name, change password
- **Delete Account** — Full CRUD operations
- **Protected Routes** — Middleware-based security

### 📦 Order Tracking
- **Real-time Tracking** — Live status updates
- **Timeline View** — Order history visualization
- **3D Package Animation** — Interactive 3D scene
- **Search Orders** — Quick tracking ID search
- **Status Badges** — Color-coded states

### 📬 Contact & Communication
- **Contact Form** — Real submission to database
- **Form Validation** — Client + server-side
- **Message Storage** — All messages saved in MongoDB

### 🎯 Dashboard
- **Stats Cards** — Orders overview
- **Real Data** — Connected to MongoDB
- **User Info** — Dynamic display
- **Order Timeline** — Visual progress

